# Analyzer dashboard handoff

Read [docs/ANALYZER_DASHBOARD_HANDOFF.md](mdc:docs/ANALYZER_DASHBOARD_HANDOFF.md) before changing the analysis screen.

## Quick facts

- Route: `/analysis/:id` → `Analysis.tsx` loads tRPC; **`PadelVideoAnalyzer`** owns layout.
- Video: `VideoPlayer` + `stageOverlay` (`AnalyzerScoreOverlay`), `forceAspectRatio={16/9}`, `suppressPhaseBadge`.
- Right rail: `AnalyzerFilterPanel` (accordion/toggles) + score/coaching/metrics.
- shadcn UI files exist under `client/src/components/ui/` but filter panel still uses **inline Radix** — migrate when touching filters.
- Filters are **UI state only**; overlay/timeline filtering not wired yet.

## Do not

- Rename or duplicate the old inline `Analysis.tsx` grid — it was refactored out.
- Block the overlay worker on the main thread.

## Typical next tasks

1. Import shadcn `accordion` / `toggle-group` in `AnalyzerFilterPanel`.
2. Pass `selectedPlayerIds` into overlay/racket rendering.
3. Replace score overlay placeholders with real match data when available.
